# Environment-specific config: never track these. .env.example is the only
# env file meant to be committed (it documents required vars with no real
# values). Real per-environment values belong in .env.local (git-ignored via
# *.local above) or, for production, in the Cloudflare Pages dashboard
# environment variables -- see DEPLOYMENT.md.
.env
.env.production
.env.development
.env.*.local

